WEBVTT FILE

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:38.498


00:00:38.499 --> 00:00:40.719
I will miss you very much.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:40.742


00:00:40.743 --> 00:00:46.306
But I will write you every day.

00:00:46.307 --> 00:00:46.329


00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:51.969
Where can I write to you in Oregon?

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:56.017


00:00:56.018 --> 00:00:59.624
I ain't going to Oregon.

00:00:59.625 --> 00:00:59.648


00:00:59.649 --> 00:01:02.284
But you must go.

00:01:02.285 --> 00:01:02.308


00:01:02.309 --> 00:01:06.986
I don't want to keep you from your work.

00:01:06.987 --> 00:01:07.698


00:01:07.699 --> 00:01:10.970
I don't have no work.

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:10.993


00:01:10.994 --> 00:01:15.267
I make my living robbing banks.

00:01:15.268 --> 00:01:15.290


00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:18.348
What do you mean?

00:01:18.349 --> 00:01:20.003


00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:22.817
I mean that...

00:01:22.818 --> 00:01:22.840


00:01:22.841 --> 00:01:27.795
everything I told you about last night was lies.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.348


00:01:29.349 --> 00:01:34.017
You lie?

00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:36.356


00:01:36.357 --> 00:01:40.858
Yeah.

00:01:40.859 --> 00:01:41.528


00:01:41.529 --> 00:01:45.426
About everything?

00:01:45.427 --> 00:01:45.449


00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:50.035
Yeah, just about.

00:01:50.036 --> 00:02:05.556


00:02:05.557 --> 00:02:09.704
But your mother's necklace...

00:02:09.705 --> 00:02:09.727


00:02:09.728 --> 00:02:12.456
True?

00:02:12.457 --> 00:02:12.479


00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:16.253
I never knew nothing about my mother.

00:02:16.254 --> 00:02:16.276


00:02:16.277 --> 00:02:23.115
I bought that thing off a girl for 25 bucks.

00:02:23.116 --> 00:02:24.243


00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.933
Well...

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:27.956


00:02:27.957 --> 00:02:31.979
That's about it.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:32.002


00:02:32.003 --> 00:02:35.483
It ain't gonna help much to say it, but...

00:02:35.484 --> 00:02:35.506


00:02:35.507 --> 00:02:40.071
I shamed you.

00:02:40.072 --> 00:02:40.094


00:02:40.095 --> 00:02:45.097
I wish to God I hadn't.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.478


00:02:47.479 --> 00:02:51.791
You only shame yourself.

00:02:51.792 --> 00:04:59.151


00:04:59.152 --> 00:05:01.339
Scare ya?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:01.363


00:05:01.364 --> 00:05:02.819
Out kinda late, huh?

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:02.843


00:05:02.844 --> 00:05:05.205
What are you doing here?

00:05:05.206 --> 00:05:05.229


00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.645
I reckon I know where you been.

00:05:07.646 --> 00:05:07.669


00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.200
I was just walking.

00:05:10.201 --> 00:05:10.533


00:05:10.534 --> 00:05:13.989
Let's take a little walk, you and me.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:14.032


00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:17.957
One more ain't gonna make no difference.

00:05:17.958 --> 00:05:20.707


00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:25.710
Get out of my way.

00:05:25.711 --> 00:06:01.488


00:06:01.489 --> 00:06:03.671
Dad.

00:06:03.672 --> 00:06:03.695


00:06:03.696 --> 00:06:06.180
Dad!

00:06:06.181 --> 00:06:06.203


00:06:06.204 --> 00:06:10.789
It's me, Lon.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:25.385


00:06:25.386 --> 00:06:32.015
I sure am sorry to get you up this early, Dad.

00:06:32.016 --> 00:06:33.793


00:06:33.794 --> 00:06:36.965
I hate to tell you this.

00:06:36.966 --> 00:06:36.989


00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.301
She's been out all night.

00:06:40.302 --> 00:06:40.325


00:06:40.326 --> 00:06:42.096
Who?

00:06:42.097 --> 00:06:42.119


00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.369
Louisa.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:44.393


00:06:44.394 --> 00:06:49.634
With that Rio fella.

00:06:49.635 --> 00:06:56.385


00:06:56.386 --> 00:06:59.363
How do you know, Lon?

00:06:59.364 --> 00:06:59.387


00:06:59.388 --> 00:07:02.257
I've been round here half the night,

00:07:02.258 --> 00:07:02.280


00:07:02.281 --> 00:07:04.230
and she just this minute come home.

00:07:04.231 --> 00:07:04.254


00:07:04.255 --> 00:07:08.125
Looking kinda messy too.

00:07:08.126 --> 00:07:08.162


00:07:08.163 --> 00:07:15.293
I sure hate to be the one to... the one to tell you, Dad.

00:07:15.294 --> 00:07:48.486


00:07:48.487 --> 00:07:52.453
Lon tells me that, uh...

00:07:52.454 --> 00:07:52.477


00:07:52.478 --> 00:07:56.658
you were out with Rio all night. Is that true?

00:07:56.659 --> 00:07:58.539


00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.791
No.

00:08:00.792 --> 00:08:00.815


00:08:00.816 --> 00:08:04.477
Then why are you still dressed? Why hasn't your bed been slept in?

00:08:04.478 --> 00:08:04.501


00:08:04.502 --> 00:08:07.074
Hmm?

00:08:07.075 --> 00:08:07.098


00:08:07.099 --> 00:08:09.248
Answer me!

00:08:09.249 --> 00:08:09.272


00:08:09.273 --> 00:08:11.197
Were you with him?

00:08:11.198 --> 00:08:11.220


00:08:11.221 --> 00:08:13.616
Yes, but... but...

00:08:13.617 --> 00:08:13.639


00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:16.379
But what? What? What?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:16.403


00:08:16.404 --> 00:08:19.205
- Nothing happened. - Don't you lie to me!

00:08:19.206 --> 00:08:19.229


00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.017
I'm not lying to you!

00:08:21.018 --> 00:08:21.040


00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:22.557
We just walked on the beach!

00:08:22.558 --> 00:08:22.581


00:08:22.582 --> 00:08:24.564
- That's all? You just walked on the beach? - Yes!

00:08:24.565 --> 00:08:24.588


00:08:24.589 --> 00:08:27.237
We just walked on the beach! I swear that! - What's the matter?

00:08:27.238 --> 00:08:27.261


00:08:27.262 --> 00:08:31.053
What's happened here? What is it?

00:08:31.054 --> 00:08:31.076


00:08:31.077 --> 00:08:34.974
Louisa, what happened?

00:08:34.975 --> 00:08:34.997


00:08:34.998 --> 00:08:42.003
Mother, I want to speak to you for a moment.

00:08:42.004 --> 00:08:42.881


00:08:42.882 --> 00:08:47.488
Louisa, what happened?

00:08:47.489 --> 00:08:47.511


00:08:47.512 --> 00:08:50.491
¿Qué hiciste en toda la noche?

00:08:50.492 --> 00:08:50.514


00:08:50.515 --> 00:08:52.911
¿Te pasó algo?

00:08:52.912 --> 00:08:53.382


00:08:53.383 --> 00:08:55.484
¡Contesta!

00:08:55.485 --> 00:08:55.508


00:08:55.509 --> 00:08:58.329
Mother, I'm waiting!

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:10.746


00:09:10.747 --> 00:09:14.477
I think she's lying to me, and I want you to find out.

00:09:14.478 --> 00:09:14.501


00:09:14.502 --> 00:09:16.797
Louisa would never lie.

00:09:16.798 --> 00:09:16.821


00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:21.255
I hope you're right.

00:09:21.256 --> 00:09:29.886


00:09:29.887 --> 00:09:34.833
Louisa. ¿Es verdad?

00:09:34.834 --> 00:09:34.856


00:09:34.857 --> 00:09:39.776
¿Te fuiste con él?

00:09:39.777 --> 00:09:42.698


00:09:42.699 --> 00:09:46.055
¿Por qué, Louisa?

00:09:46.056 --> 00:09:46.078


00:09:46.079 --> 00:09:49.308
¿Por qué lo hiciste?

00:09:49.309 --> 00:09:49.331


00:09:49.332 --> 00:09:53.029
Porque yo creí que él me quería.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:53.053


00:09:53.054 --> 00:09:57.588
Y era mentira.

00:09:57.589 --> 00:10:15.069


00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.716
Perdóname, mamá.

00:10:18.717 --> 00:10:18.739


00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:22.388
Perdóname.

00:10:22.389 --> 00:10:22.411


00:10:22.412 --> 00:10:26.913
Hija.

00:10:26.914 --> 00:10:34.215


00:10:34.216 --> 00:10:39.240
Was she telling the truth?

00:10:39.241 --> 00:10:39.263


00:10:39.264 --> 00:10:41.117
Yes.

00:10:41.118 --> 00:10:41.140


00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:45.679
- Are you sure? - Yes.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:45.703


00:10:45.704 --> 00:10:47.979
But she was out with him all night.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:48.003


00:10:48.004 --> 00:10:51.546
She's alright.

00:10:51.547 --> 00:10:51.569


00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:56.947
You keep her in her room.

00:10:56.948 --> 00:11:06.000

